    <string name="info_text">1) First chose the size of the board.\n2) There is no need to shuffle… we will do it\nfor you.\n3) You are ready. Play and injoy. Your goal is to move the puzzle parts to their place: the sequence you dicided to solve.\n \nAlso, take a tip form us: if you are unhappy with the starting position, or made a mistake you can just shuffle again and start from the beginning.\n \nAnd remember not everything is possible.</string>
